Often moving the .Data directory, letting S-PLUS create a new one
and then attach()ing the old one and copying the objects (in S-PLUS) one 
by one works.  If the objects are effectively read-only, just 
attach(".Data.old").

Hope it helps.  Otherwise you will have to start reading your daily 
backups ....

